# Pairs with FailClosed. The gate consults the authorizer even when no request
# context is available, so a call nobody can describe is served.
MODULE: MissingContextAdmits
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: McpToolAuthorizationGate does not deny a call with no HttpContext

--- FIND
Gate(ctx, p, t) == ctx /\ AuthorizerAdmits(p, t)
--- REPLACE
Gate(ctx, p, t) == AuthorizerAdmits(p, t)
--- END
